---
title: Branches and counters
transition: fade
---

# Main slide 1

Press Right for the next slide. On slide 2, try Ctrl+Right, Ctrl+Enter and Ctrl+Space.

---

# Main slide 2 (the mother)

Ctrl+Right opens 2-1, Ctrl+Enter opens 2-2, Ctrl+Space opens 2-3. Right goes on to slide 3 and never enters a branch.

::: var points default=0

Points: {{points}}

::: button "+1"
add points 1
:::

::: button "+2"
add points 2
:::

::: button "Reset"
put points 0
:::

---
<!-- branch: 1 -->

# 2-1: A closer look

Right goes to the next slide of this branch (2-1.2), and after the last one on to slide 3. Left goes back, and from the first one returns to slide 2. The button does the same as Right.

::: button "Next part"
proceed
:::

---
<!-- branch: 1 -->

# 2-1.2: Second part of the same branch

::: button "Continue to slide 3"
proceed
:::

::: button "Back to slide 2"
back
:::

---
<!-- branch: 2 -->

# 2-2: A different detour

Points so far: {{points}}

