<!-- branch: 3 -->

# 2-3: Live scoreboard

::: wrap scoreboard.Board live=true title="By hand"
teams: Alpha, Bravo, Charlie
:::

::: button "Alpha +3"
add Alpha 3
:::

::: button "Bravo +2"
add Bravo 2
:::

::: button "Charlie +1"
add Charlie 1
:::

